   "sourceHash": "ba638905e65225f0c4764ce6cb667950f0ead3c0e0c5b9a6270f7fc43ec9a764",
   "text": "¿Qué le gustaría que supiéramos? Cuéntenos su experiencia y cómo le gustaría que le ayudáramos.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_260e977ae523282c8f0b",
   "sourceHash": "260e977ae523282c8f0b2e047b0fb9567d9c8069b70c137babbe536b83ae2252",
   "text": "/1,500 caracteres · Solo sus comentarios son obligatorios. Añada cualquier detalle sobre el que desee que hagamos un seguimiento.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Number '1,500' kept verbatim as required by the keep-numbers rule; Spanish convention would be 1500 / 1.500 — owner may wish to localize the number format."
   ]
  },
  {
